      "schema_version": "aspr_gear",
      "text": "This work presents an automated LCW microfluidic platform for ultrafast photocatalytic [2 + 2] cycloaddition, online UV-vis characterization, and large-scale condition screening. It combines non-steady-state measurements with absorbance prediction to increase reported screening throughput, and it uses the resulting dataset for cross-substrate and cross-photocatalyst prediction. The core platform and dataset are concrete contributions; the cross-species ML component remains a preliminary retrospective extension rather than a demonstrated proactive optimization workflow."
    },
